        "en": "The emergency handling URL."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Level",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "Long",
      "required": true,
      "description": {
        "zh": "Prometheus告警规则的等级。\n\n- P1：一般用于影响核心业务可用性，影响范围很大，可能导致严重后果的重大问题的告警通知。\n- P2：一般用于部分业务出错，会对系统可用性造成一定影响，但是影响范围相对有限的问题的告警通知。\n- P3：一般用于对可能导致业务出错或者受影响的问题的告警通知，或者在相对重要程度较低的业务发送的告警通知。\n- P4： 用于需要通知，但是优先级较低，也不会对业务造成影响的场景发送告警通知。\n- 默认：如果不需要区分告警等级，可以使用默认级别。",
        "en": "The severity level of the Prometheus alert rule.\n\n- P1: used for alert notifications about critical issues that affect the availability of core services, have a wide impact, and may cause severe consequences.\n- P2: used for alert notifications about issues where some services encounter errors and service availability is affected to a certain extent, but the impact is relatively limited.\n- P3: used for alert notifications about issues that may cause service errors or affect services, or for alert notifications sent for services of relatively low importance.\n- P4: used for alert notifications in scenarios that require notification but have a low priority and do not affect services.\n- Default: if you do not need to distinguish alert severity levels, use the default level."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Name",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "String",
      "required": true,
      "description": {
        "zh": "报警规则名称",
        "en": "The name of the alert rule."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "NotifyFiring",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "Long",
      "required": true,
      "description": {
        "zh": "告警触发时通知 1:勾选 0:不勾选",
        "en": "Specifies whether to send a notification when the alert is triggered. Valid values: 1: selected. 0: not selected."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "NotifyNodata",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "Long",
      "required": true,
      "description": {
        "zh": "待删除的订阅数据总量",
        "en": "The total amount of subscription data to be deleted."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "NotifyRecovered",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "Long",
      "required": true,
      "description": {
        "zh": "告警恢复时通知 1:勾选 0:不勾选",
        "en": "Specifies whether to send a notification when the alert is resolved. Valid values: 1: selected. 0: not selected."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "NotifyTarget",
      "position": "Body",
      "type": "RepeatList",
      "required": false,
